{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Introduce Stronger Laws to Protect Holiday Park Home Buyers from Unfair Practice",
        "additional_details": "Many people invest their life savings in holiday park homes, believing they are buying a dream lifestyle, only to face unexpected fees, restrictive contracts, depreciation and difficulties selling. Some owners feel trapped, with little protection or recourse. Having experienced this ourselves, we believe the industry needs greater transparency, accountability and independent regulation to prevent more families from suffering devastating financial losses.",
        "background": "We want the Government to introduce stricter regulation of the UK holiday park industry, protecting buyers from misleading sales tactics, unfair contracts, excessive site fees and financial exploitation. Introduce independent oversight and stronger legal rights for holiday park home owners.",
